#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD9705 expect=violation domain=LB
# Rule:Description: PMDA-SD9705 — the Required key LBTEST is not populated.
#note "LBTEST blank -> violation; the twin scenario differs only in the value of LBTEST."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset LB
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col LBSEQ type=Char
col LBTESTCD type=Char
col LBTEST type=Char
---
S1      | LB     | S1-001  | 1     | ALB      |
---
